:"Star Trek: The Original Series","st":"Tomorrow Is Yesterday","d":"The U.S.S. Enterprise is thrown into a time warp and ends up orbiting Earth in the 20th century.","c":["Science fiction","Series","Adventure"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6969f419b9f75c652f696d66/tile_1776461041376.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S01E19"}]